# Tests

- Every change keeps the existing tests passing. Add a test when you add behaviour.
- Tests must pass without a real API key. Use the fixtures and stand-ins already in `tests/`.
- When a test fails, fix the project. Do not weaken a test to make it pass.
- Before a pull request is ready, run the commands in [Tests](../../AGENTS.md#tests).
- GitHub runs `pytest`, `ruff check .`, and `ruff format --check .` on every pull request and on every push to main.
